Date: Sat, 4 Jul 2026 14:49:07 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 09/24] feat(payment): redesign success state as payment
 receipt and fix dummy cart data

- Replace hardcoded dummy values in payment result screen with actual CartSummary and OrderConfirmation data

- Redesign Order Confirmed UI into a detailed receipt view showing total, items, and payment method

- Add staggered animations to receipt elements, respecting accessibility reduced motion preferences

- Require user interaction (Done button) to finalize the payment flow and emit PaymentResult
